# Draft:79th Primetime Emmy Awards

| presenter = Academy of Television Arts & Sciences
}}
The 79th Primetime Emmy Awards will honor the best in American prime time programming from June 1, 2026 until May 31, 2027, as chosen by the Academy of Television Arts & Sciences. The awards ceremony will be scheduled to air live on September 14, 2027, at the Peacock Theater in Downtown Los Angeles, California, and will be preceded by the 79th Primetime Creative Arts Emmy Awards on September 5 and 6.
